# Notes for Drawio Desktop SMC Version

This version of Drawio Desktop is an adaptation of Drawio for use in the Systems Modeling Community

In particular its purpose is to produce manually authored graphical symbols and views for the SysML v2 specification, 
mainly for the Representative Notation Tables in clause 7 and the Graphical Notation in clause 8.2.3.

The relevant repositories are:

* https://github.com/Systems-Modeling/drawio-desktop-SMC forked from https://github.com/jgraph/drawio-desktop
* https://github.com/Systems-Modeling/drawio-SMC forked from https://github.com/jgraph/drawio

The working branch is named `SMC`.

See https://github.com/Systems-Modeling/drawio-desktop-SMC/blob/SMC/DEVELOPMENT-SMC-version.md 
for instructions on how to develop and build the SMC version of Drawio Desktop.
